    "title": "Minnesota Lynx star Olivia Miles wins 4th straight WNBA Rookie of the Month honor - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Wald ,\n8 hours ago MINNEAPOLIS (FOX 9) - She's rewriting the record books, and she's just getting started. Minnesota Lynx guard Olivia Miles has been named the Kia WNBA Rookie of the Month for August, earning the honor for the fourth consecutive month and becoming the first rookie in franchise history to do so. Read full article\n1",
